# IND and NEL move the cursor down and RI up, and each scrolls the region
# at its margin; NEL also moves to the first column. Outside the region,
# they stop at the screen's first or last row and scroll nothing.
# spec: the VT510 manual, IND and NEL; the VT220 manual, chapter 4, RI; ECMA-48 8.3.86 NEL and 8.3.104 RI
# covers: ctl.edit
size 10 5
send "1\r\n2\r\n3\r\n4\r\n5"
send "\e[1;1H\eM"
dump state
send "\e[2;4r\e[4;3H\eDX\eDY"
dump state
send "\e[2;3H\eMZ\eMW"
dump state
send "\e[5;3H\eE\eEN"
dump state
send "\e[1;3H\eMQ"
dump state
